{"id":"d1121e6ff027ff98","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter Proper Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter-proper-filter — ZFC Filter Proper Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter","58-df-zfc-filter2-proper-filter","58-df-zfc-filter6-proper-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter-proper-filter — ZFC Filter Proper Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-filter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter2-proper-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter6-proper-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter-proper-filter — ZFC Filter Proper Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,\\mathcal F,X \\in V\">\\(F,\\mathcal F,X \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S \\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S \\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProperFilter}_S \\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProperFilter}_S \\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProperFilter}_S \\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProperFilter}_S \\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}proper\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(F,X)\\leftrightarrow F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in F\\land\\emptyset\\notin F\\land\\forall A,B\\in F\\;(A\\cap B\\in F)\\land\\forall A\\in F\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}proper\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(F,X)\\leftrightarrow F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in F\\land\\emptyset\\notin F\\land\\forall A,B\\in F\\;(A\\cap B\\in F)\\land\\forall A\\in F\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}proper\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}proper\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}proper\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProperFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}proper\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProperFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the ordinary proper filter on the Boolean algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>, not the unrelated forcing notion of properness.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-filter2-proper-filter</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-filter6-proper-filter</code> are merged here; they used the same proper-filter closure conditions with parameter-order variants.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,\\mathcal F,X \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S \\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProperFilter}_S \\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProperFilter}_S \\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}proper\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(F,X)\\leftrightarrow F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in F\\land\\emptyset\\notin F\\land\\forall A,B\\in F\\;(A\\cap B\\in F)\\land\\forall A\\in F\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in F)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}proper\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}proper\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProperFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":1592,"backlinks":[{"id":"3cdfb6932a1bb4ab","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]])"},{"id":"796cdc660bbc6e8a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]])"},{"id":"6d423b981f2223af","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]])"},{"id":"cdca8bcec9339871","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]])"},{"id":"c6e0d4fd97c5ef41","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S$ (proper-filter predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter]])"},{"id":"c6ba04763086ca5d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1880","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md|58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1331244a5201bb99"]}